<!-- Main Content -->
<div class="container py-5">

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-3">
            <div class="border border-1 border-dark bg-welfare-left text-light h-100">
                <h3 class="fw-bold text-uppercase" style=" font-weight: 600; font-size: 21px; margin-top: 10px;">Quick navigation</h3>
                <hr />
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" style="font-size:16px;"></i> UP Scholarship</li>
                    <hr>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" style="font-size:16px;"></i> NSP Portal</li>
                    <hr>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" style="font-size:16px;"></i> Contact Us</li>
                    <hr>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" style="font-size:16px;"></i> Information Brochure </li>
                   
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2 p-3 bg-white" style="border:1px dashed #000">
                <div class="row p-2">
                    <div class="col-lg-4 ps-0">
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <img src="https://recp.ac.in/Content/img/Er.%20Prashant%20PathaK.jpg" height="200" class="w-100 dsd" style="object-fit:cover; border:1px dashed #212529;" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-8 mt-5">
                        <div class="text-lg-end h-100 text-center">
                            <h2 style="color: #0747AE;font-weight:700;">Scholarship Coordinator</h2>
                            <p class="m-0 p-0  welfare-font"><i>Er. Prashant Pathak</i></p>
                            <p class="m-0 p-0  welfare-font"> +91-76519-84765</p>
                           
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-12 welfare-font">
                        <h3 class="fw-bold mt-3 mb-0 mt-3" style="color: #0747AE;font-weight:700;">UP Scholarship Scheme</h3>
                        <p class="m-0 text-justify  mt-3">
                            The UP Scholarship is a financial aid scheme launched by the Government of
                            Uttar Pradesh to support students from economically weaker backgrounds in
                            pursuing their education without financial constraints. It is available for
                            students belonging to SC, ST, OBC, Minority, and General categories who are
                            residents of Uttar Pradesh. The scholarship covers a wide range of courses,
                            including diploma, undergraduate, and postgraduate programs. Eligible
                            students can apply online through the official portal scholarship.up.gov.in,
                            where they are required to fill in their academic and income details, upload
                            personal details, and track the status of their application. This scheme helps
                            students continue their studies smoothly by offering financial support for
                            tuition fees and other educational expenses.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-12 welfare-font">
                        <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0 mt-4" style="color: #0747AE;font-weight:700;">National Scholarship Portal(NSP)</h3>
                        <p class="m-0 text-justify mt-3 ">
                            The National Scholarship Portal (NSP) is a centralized platform launched by
                            the Government of India to provide various scholarship schemes offered by
                            central ministries, UGC, AICTE, and state governments. It aims to ensure
                            timely disbursement of scholarships to eligible students through a transparent
                            and streamlined process. Students from categories (Gen, SC, ST, OBC, and
                            Minorities), economically weaker sections, and those with disabilities can
                            apply for different scholarships based on eligibility. Applications are submitted
                            online through scholarships.gov.in, where students need to register, fill in their
                            details, upload the necessary documents, and submit the form. The NSP
                            simplifies the scholarship process and ensures that deserving students across
                            India receive financial aid directly into their bank accounts.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-3 d-flex flex-column gap-2">
            <div class="row h-100">
                <div class="col-lg-12">
                    <div class="bg-welfare-left text-light text-center h-100">
                        <h4><span class="text-decoration-underline fw-bold">NOTICES</span></h4>
                        <hr />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row h-100">
                <div class="col-lg-12">
                    <div class="bg-welfare-left text-light text-center h-100">
                        <h4><span class="text-decoration-underline fw-bold">EVENT CALENDAR</span></h4>
                        <hr />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>